.TH okf-jawn-set_rules 1  "set_rules " 
.SH NAME
okf\-jawn\-set_rules \- Save explicit rules as versioned context.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBokf\-jawn set_rules\fR [\fB\-\-server\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Save explicit rules as versioned context.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-server\fR [default: http://127.0.0.1:7711]

.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR [default: {}]
